"""Origin framing and evidence audit extension.

Channels are independent compressed byte streams of concatenated capture parts.
Consecutive HTTP/1.1 requests are framed from byte zero; fully framed requests
contribute records and parsing stops at the first syntax error or unfinished
request.  The audit attributes every raw request byte to its capture part owner,
